(6915244, 1042788, 40391, '<td valign="top">A wonderful image. Lovely lighting, well processed and I really like the slight movement captured and the rain from the street light. And being funny just adds that little extra</td>', 'A wonderful image. Lovely lighting, well processed and I really like the slight movement captured and the rain from the street light. And being funny just adds that little extra', '2012-11-28 13:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
