(6915420, 1042803, 155989, '<td valign="top">Pleasing simple composition. Perhaps would have been more striking if the umbrellas were all the same colour. And I have to confess that symmetry is a bit of a thing for me so for me personally I feel that its a pity that the wind (?) moved the blue and white one.</td>', 'Pleasing simple composition. Perhaps would have been more striking if the umbrellas were all the same colour. And I have to confess that symmetry is a bit of a thing for me so for me personally I feel that its a pity that the wind (?) moved the blue and white one.', '2012-11-28 19:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915422, 1042348, 155989, '<td valign="top">Reminds me so much of the pen and ink drawing of Pooh Bear and Christopher Robin trying to pretend Pooh was a raincloud: <br/> <br/>Winnie the Pooh: Christopher Robin! I think it would help with this deception if you would just kind of open your umbrella and say, "Tut-tut, it looks like rain."</td>', 'Reminds me so much of the pen and ink drawing of Pooh Bear and Christopher Robin trying to pretend Pooh was a raincloud:  Winnie the Pooh: Christopher Robin! I think it would help with this deception if you would just kind of open your umbrella and say, "Tut-tut, it looks like rain."', '2012-11-28 19:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915423, 1042701, 155989, '<td valign="top">Without the title I''m not sure I would have known what this was, so for me, on that level this doesn''t work so well. Sorry :(</td>', 'Without the title I''m not sure I would have known what this was, so for me, on that level this doesn''t work so well. Sorry :(', '2012-11-28 19:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915425, 1042444, 155989, '<td valign="top">Simple graphic image, movement well captured. I like the placement of the umbrella.</td>', 'Simple graphic image, movement well captured. I like the placement of the umbrella.', '2012-11-28 19:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915426, 1042780, 155989, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Clever title.</td>', 'Interesting image. Clever title.', '2012-11-28 19:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915427, 1042573, 155989, '<td valign="top">Striking use of selective colour. Strong composition.</td>', 'Striking use of selective colour. Strong composition.', '2012-11-28 19:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915428, 1042797, 155989, '<td valign="top">Very cheerful.</td>', 'Very cheerful.', '2012-11-28 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915429, 1042821, 155989, '<td valign="top">I think perhaps that this is one instance where DOF blur wasn''t desired. At least for me personally slightly less blur and slightly more background detail would have been better. It''s such an intriguing picture I''m squinting trying to see the detail.</td>', 'I think perhaps that this is one instance where DOF blur wasn''t desired. At least for me personally slightly less blur and slightly more background detail would have been better. It''s such an intriguing picture I''m squinting trying to see the detail.', '2012-11-28 19:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915430, 1042833, 155989, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect with the reflection even with the slightly less than impressed subject.</td>', 'Interesting effect with the reflection even with the slightly less than impressed subject.', '2012-11-28 19:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915432, 1042808, 155989, '<td valign="top">The puppies on the umbrella were a bit of a cuteness overkill LOL but very clever!</td>', 'The puppies on the umbrella were a bit of a cuteness overkill LOL but very clever!', '2012-11-28 19:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
