(6915434, 1042795, 155989, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. Not sure if you put the still life together but really lovely monochromatic palette. Just a pity about the white chair behind which, for me, distracts a little.</td>', 'Lovely composition. Not sure if you put the still life together but really lovely monochromatic palette. Just a pity about the white chair behind which, for me, distracts a little.', '2012-11-28 19:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
