(6915446, 1042578, 155989, '<td valign="top">Oddly effective image and title. Immediately made me think ''so long as you don''t mind been hot, itchy and sandy''. So it worked. Not your fault I don''t like the beach.</td>', 'Oddly effective image and title. Immediately made me think ''so long as you don''t mind been hot, itchy and sandy''. So it worked. Not your fault I don''t like the beach.', '2012-11-28 20:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
