(6921157, 1042059, 69034, '<td valign="top">The best interpretation in the contest thus far in my voting.  Nice.</td>', 'The best interpretation in the contest thus far in my voting.  Nice.', '2012-12-03 13:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921159, 1042818, 69034, '<td valign="top">The minute I saw this my head yelled, "I hold Excalibur, umbrella of kings since the dawn of time!"</td>', 'The minute I saw this my head yelled, "I hold Excalibur, umbrella of kings since the dawn of time!"', '2012-12-03 13:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921161, 1042709, 69034, '<td valign="top">Neat Idea.</td>', 'Neat Idea.', '2012-12-03 13:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921167, 1042711, 69034, '<td valign="top">This image has an awesome feel to it.  I love the low tone black and white.</td>', 'This image has an awesome feel to it.  I love the low tone black and white.', '2012-12-03 13:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921172, 1042710, 69034, '<td valign="top">The idea was very cute, but as a piece of advice (that I earned the hard way), I would pull the object awy from the wall in a situation like this.  It will make the shadows less of an issue if you had shot from several feet away from  the wall.</td>', 'The idea was very cute, but as a piece of advice (that I earned the hard way), I would pull the object awy from the wall in a situation like this.  It will make the shadows less of an issue if you had shot from several feet away from  the wall.', '2012-12-03 13:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921443, 1042833, 30049, '<td valign="top">This location looks vaguely familiar - shot before looking through the glass I think?  Anyway ... I like the creative find of this umbrella.  Much better than all of the posed / setup shots.  Nice color and contrast - well done.</td>', 'This location looks vaguely familiar - shot before looking through the glass I think?  Anyway ... I like the creative find of this umbrella.  Much better than all of the posed / setup shots.  Nice color and contrast - well done.', '2012-12-03 17:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921447, 1042803, 30049, '<td valign="top">LOL - Love the foot prints.  :-D  On a more "photographic" note - seems to be a fair amount of noise in this.  Shot with a high ISO, or pulled up the shadows in post?  A little cleanup would have added a nice touch of polish (and a rake).  He-he.</td>', 'LOL - Love the foot prints.  :-D  On a more "photographic" note - seems to be a fair amount of noise in this.  Shot with a high ISO, or pulled up the shadows in post?  A little cleanup would have added a nice touch of polish (and a rake).  He-he.', '2012-12-03 17:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
