(6923408, 1042757, 75713, '<td valign="top">I was so surprised this scored below a 5 - I gave it a 7 and was going to go back and up my votes on a few shots, this one included, after I finished voting. I got distracted and didn''t follow through.  These clouds are not common - they look as if they are protecting the trees from the coming storm.  This shot is perfectly photographed, processed just right and is a creative and interesting take on the challenge. <br/> <br/>I did a set up shot and it was boring.  The model was too close to the b/g to give it the oof look it needed and it scored higher than yours - ridiculous. <br/> <br/>I have been away for quite some time and only enter sporadically and I am amazed at how photos are now being judged on DP - people used to maybe take off one point if they didn''t think it fit the challenge but now - 1, 2 and 3 votes are the norm.  I long for the old days and have gone back to voting as my way of protesting and your entry is another incentive for me to continue.  Thank you .</td>', 'I was so surprised this scored below a 5 - I gave it a 7 and was going to go back and up my votes on a few shots, this one included, after I finished voting. I got distracted and didn''t follow through.  These clouds are not common - they look as if they are protecting the trees from the coming storm.  This shot is perfectly photographed, processed just right and is a creative and interesting take on the challenge.  I did a set up shot and it was boring.  The model was too close to the b/g to give it the oof look it needed and it scored higher than yours - ridiculous.  I have been away for quite some time and only enter sporadically and I am amazed at how photos are now being judged on DP - people used to maybe take off one point if they didn''t think it fit the challenge but now - 1, 2 and 3 votes are the norm.  I long for the old days and have gone back to voting as my way of protesting and your entry is another incentive for me to continue.  Thank you .', '2012-12-05 03:29:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6923412, 1042828, 127021, '<td valign="top">great story and great image - one of my top picks in this challenge.  I love overhead lighted shots at night and this is really well done considering the editing limitations. congrats!</td>', 'great story and great image - one of my top picks in this challenge.  I love overhead lighted shots at night and this is really well done considering the editing limitations. congrats!', '2012-12-05 03:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
